sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant F as FIX Gateway
    participant R as Risk Engine
    participant S as Sequencer
    participant P as Primary ME
    participant B as Standby ME
    participant J as Journal
    participant M as Market Data Pub
    actor MDS as Data Subscriber

    C->>F: Place Order (Symbol, Side, Price, Qty)
    F->>R: Validate Order
    R-->>F: Order Validated (Funds Held)
    F->>S: Forward Validated Order
    
    par Multicast Sequenced Order
        S->>P: Sequenced Order Log
        S->>B: Sequenced Order Log
        S->>J: Sequenced Order Log
    end

    J-->>J: Persist to Disk
    B-->>B: Deterministic State Update (Outputs Dropped)
    
    P-->>P: Execute Matching Logic
    
    par Publish Results
        P->>F: Execution / Fill Report
        P->>M: Order Book Deltas (Trades)
    end
    
    F->>C: Execution Report to Client
    M->>MDS: L2 Depth / Trade Broadcast
